{
  "_why_disabled": [
    "These two events registered nothing. With them present in hooks/hooks.json,",
    "NO hook from this plugin appeared under /hooks — not even the ordinary",
    "PreToolUse gate in the same file — across a quit/resume and a clean restart.",
    "",
    "That points at whole-file rejection on an unrecognized event name rather than",
    "at these entries being skipped individually. Supporting evidence: no other",
    "installed plugin uses either event. Across every hooks.json on this machine the",
    "events in use are PreToolUse, PostToolUse, SessionStart, Stop, UserPromptSubmit,",
    "and UserPromptExpansion. Both events are documented, so this may be a version",
    "gate, may be tied to the agent-teams machinery, or may need the matcher omitted",
    "the way SessionStart and Stop hooks omit it in working plugins.",
    "",
    "To re-enable: merge the `hooks` block below into hooks/hooks.json, restart",
    "Claude Code (hooks load at session start), and check /hooks. If the PreToolUse",
    "gate disappears again, the event name is the cause and this file stays disabled.",
    "",
    "The scripts themselves are verified and remain in hooks/. They block correctly",
    "when fed payloads directly; only registration is in question."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "TeammateIdle": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/enforce-terminal-state.sh\"",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "TaskCompleted": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/enforce-task-complete.sh\"",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
